  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A detector measures the count rate from a sample of a radioactive nuclide. The graph shows the variation with time of the count rate.</p>\n<p>The nuclide has a half-life of 20 s. The average background count rate is constant.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the average background count rate?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">1 s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">2 s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">3 s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">4 s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
